msgid "When ammonium chloride reacts with dil. HCL,<br> the resultant salt will be ammonium chloride. It is an acidic salt."
msgstr "When ammonium chloride reacts with dil. HCL,<br> the resultant salt will be ammonium chloride. It is an acidic salt."

msgid "Hydrochloric acid reacts with sodium hydroxide<br> to form sodium chloride (the salt) and water on the boiling tube.<br> sodium chloride is comprise of Na<sup>+</sup> cations from the base (NaOH)<br> and Cl<sup>-</sup> anions from the acid (HCl)."+"<br> HCl+NaOH→H<sub>2</sub>O+NaCl"
msgstr "Hydrochloric acid reacts with sodium hydroxide<br> to form sodium chloride (the salt) and water on the boiling tube.<br> sodium chloride is comprise of Na<sup>+</sup> cations from the base (NaOH)<br> and Cl<sup>-</sup> anions from the acid (HCl)."+"<br> HCl+NaOH→H<sub>2</sub>O+NaCl"

msgid "Pass the liberated gas evolved from the boiling tube through <br> the lime water in a test tube. The lime water turns milky.<br/>" +"The gas evolved when dil. HCL reacts with sodium carbonate decahydrate<br> is passed through lime water, lime water turns milky or <br> white precipitate of calcium carbonate is formed.<br>"+ " Ca(OH)<sub>2</sub> (aq) + CO<sub>2</sub> (g) →  CaCO<sub>3</sub> (s) + H<sub>2</sub>O (l)"
msgstr "Pass the liberated gas evolved from the boiling tube through <br> the lime water in a test tube. The lime water turns milky.<br/>" +"The gas evolved when dil. HCL reacts with sodium carbonate decahydrate<br> is passed through lime water, lime water turns milky or <br> white precipitate of calcium carbonate is formed.<br>"+ " Ca(OH)<sub>2</sub> (aq) + CO<sub>2</sub> (g) →  CaCO<sub>3</sub> (s) + H<sub>2</sub>O (l)"

